    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for thread-safe access with exclusive locking. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides thread-safe access to a value using a mutex. All accesses are protected by the mutex, preventing data races.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of value to protect </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
